## Error Prevention Rule (MANDATORY)
Before adding any new API call to existing pages:
1. ALL optional API calls must catch ALL errors — never rethrow 401/403 from optional fetches
2. New endpoints return 404 when unimplemented — never 401
3. Finance Hub Promise.all: each call independently safe-to-fail
4. Test: does failure cause logout or crash? Isolate if yes.
5. cursorrules violation = same as breaking platform reputation rule
